{"server":"tw","storyId":"act21side_level_act21side_05_beg","groupId":"act21side","stageId":"act21side_05","title":"恆久法則","storyCode":"IS-5","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act21side/level_act21side_05_beg.txt","sourceHash":"97ac1c4adf078fcc5a048e536202ec6915b67502be6d8d56fe25b12ab0b2c5e8","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"瓦拉赫憤怒於德克薩斯的選擇，拉維妮婭提出要見貝納爾多，準備質問他的選擇。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g7_reception"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我也考慮過萊昂圖索在誆我的可能性，但是，一見到你我就知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是貨真價實的德克薩斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"容我自我介紹一下，我是羅塞蒂家族的瓦拉赫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是哥倫比亞人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，羅塞蒂家族的大部分成員都是哥倫比亞人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如何，這裡的監獄生活？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼特別的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真奇怪，照理說，你不應該在監獄裡待這麼久，貝洛內到底是怎麼想的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遵紀守法，很奇怪嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遵紀守法？但是敘拉古的法院，跟所謂的法律真的有關係嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比如，在大部分的敘拉古城市，一個家族成員的成年禮，就是上一次法庭，進一次監獄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後，他的家族成員會像迎接一名戰士一樣，將他帶回家族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個國家表面上的一切，對我們這種身處地下秩序的人來說，都形同虛設。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是在哥倫比亞長大的人，難道還需要我來解釋嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“可笑”，我沒有除此以外的評價。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，也拜此所賜，我們才能夠如此順利地在這裡扎根。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很喜歡和人聊政治嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來你不喜歡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實我也不喜歡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就直說吧，你為什麼沒有死？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"與你無關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，那我換個問法，你為什麼要回來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊昂圖索沒有告訴你嗎？我欠貝洛內一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，我是不是可以理解為，你知道貝洛內是為了讓你對付我們羅塞蒂才讓你回來的，你還是回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也是回來之後才知道的，不過——你確實可以這麼理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的坦誠甚至讓我懷疑是不是我出了問題，最後的德克薩斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道你要告訴我，你已經完全忘記了，德克薩斯這個姓氏曾經統領著哥倫比亞大大小小的家族？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的爺爺，薩爾瓦多雷曾經是每一個哥倫比亞家族成員的信仰？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯留下的一切，都與我無關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都與你無關？！"},{"type":"narration","text":"瓦拉赫一拳打在旁邊的茶几上，鮮血從手指上流了下來。\n而他彷彿渾然未覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是切利尼娜·德克薩斯！薩爾瓦多雷的孫女！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你只要活著，那些東西就與你有關！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"光是你的名字出現在羅塞蒂的會議桌上，就會讓我們不得不去改變行動的方針！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們曾經以德克薩斯為榮！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了不讓薩爾瓦多雷的心血白費，你知不知道，喬萬娜花了多少力氣才將剩下的哥倫比亞家族重新統合起來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知不知道，我們如何向西西里夫人卑躬屈膝，最終選擇向敘拉古回流，從哥倫比亞千里迢迢返回敘拉古？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了生存，我們甚至將建造移動城市的技術和盤托出，幾乎在免費為敘拉古建造新的移動城市——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這一切都是因為德克薩斯的隕落，我們不得不接受了這個事實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而現在，你，最後的德克薩斯，堂而皇之地踏上了這片土地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卻說你與這一切無關，你只是來還債。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你甚至站在了我們的對立面！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你欠貝洛內的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你活著，那你欠哥倫比亞家族的更多！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我或許欠喬萬娜一個交代，但我不欠哥倫比亞家族的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"完成和貝洛內的約定後，我會離開敘拉古。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得我會相信嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的存在，就是對羅塞蒂根基的動搖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喬萬娜呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我問，為什麼是你來見我，而不是喬萬娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是她的代言人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她不會說，向西西里夫人卑躬屈膝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她也不會派一個使者來見我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以為你瞭解她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從你的表現來看，或許是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......真可惜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來，我還是不夠瞭解傳聞中的德克薩斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為我的演技不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不算差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，你高談闊論著敘拉古，彷彿已經看穿了這個國家的樣子，讓我覺得......很熟悉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不推薦你這麼做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為這意味著......你還不夠瞭解這個國家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，有一點你說得對，我既然回來了，應該和喬萬娜聊一聊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你見不到她的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，最後的德克薩斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你太像一個敘拉古人了，不，你是一個徹頭徹尾的敘拉古人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我不能讓你見首領。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你會動搖她，你會動搖許多人，你會毀了許多東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，請回吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去履行你和貝洛內的約定吧，然後，滾回你苟且偷生的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想做什麼都是你的自由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，唯獨有一點，請你記住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅塞蒂家族，不歡迎你。"},{"type":"narration","text":"德克薩斯站起身，向門口走去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"殺手們不自覺地為她讓出一條道路。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她環視一圈，從這些哥倫比亞人的眼中讀出了憤怒，不解，厭惡，困惑等等情緒。\n這就是這個姓氏帶來的東西。\n德克薩斯。\n她歎了口氣，走出房間。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"稀客。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要見貝納爾多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我提醒過你很多次，不要直呼首領的名字，拉維妮婭小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道他在哪，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有什麼理由必須告訴你嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我現在站在這裡，聽完你作為勝利者的嘲諷，可以讓你告訴我的話，我不在乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"勝利者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴你也無妨，首領已經啟程去薩盧佐家族的宅邸了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你見不到他的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想在這座宅子怎麼鬧，都是你的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，首領既然決定去和薩盧佐家談，那麼，我勸你不要做多餘的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用你提醒我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以及，拉維妮婭小姐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼看待我，我並不在乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我希望你不要忘記。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊昂是這個家族的一員，是他偏離了家族應有的軌道在先。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是一個家族，一個家族應當齊心協力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"軌道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何必把野心說得這麼好聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g1_srcstreet"},{"type":"narration","text":"一滴雨滴打在眼眶，順流而下，像是一道淚痕。\n拉維妮婭從來沒有感覺到敘拉古的雨是如此冰冷。\n但她馬上擦去了雨痕。\n還不到時候。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":true,"text":"哪位？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我找企鵝物流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":true,"text":"我就是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在有空嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":true,"text":"正好有一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們公司都有什麼業務？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":true,"text":"送信，送話，送貨，還有......送人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":true,"text":"風雨無阻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正好，我有一份委託。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g8_srcroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，空，你果然在卡特琳娜小姐家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡有好多資料，而且不少劇本中都能看到卡特琳娜小姐的筆記。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"她真的很喜歡自己的職業呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別歎氣啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都知道，你也不想把演員事業只是當做尋找德克薩斯的手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，但是，眼下的情況，還是要以見到德克薩斯為優先呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟，連那個拉普蘭德也回到了敘拉古，而且還做了那麼出格的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實想一想也是理所當然的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總覺得她會出現在一切德克薩斯會出現的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"你們覺得，她是想要幫德克薩斯才那麼做的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然結果上來說，德克薩斯的嫌疑確實被洗清了，但是怎麼想都很奇怪吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我也覺得，她應該是有自己的目的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我是真的不擅長應付這個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說是德克薩斯的朋友肯定談不上，但是，如果是仇家，哪有態度這麼曖昧的仇家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"搞不清楚她到底想在德克薩斯身上找到什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但她之前送我的千層酥還蠻好吃的欸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吃貨閉嘴啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以前也猜不透莫斯提馬在想什麼，但是等我逐漸不去想這件事後，我反而有點理解了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得拉普蘭德也是一樣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像她們這樣的人，與其去猜她們到底在想什麼，不如乾脆地接受她們的每一句話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有相信她們的每一句話都是真的，才能看穿她們最後是不是在用真實編織一個謊言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我先去買點吃的，能天使，護衛就拜託你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"空，又在練台詞呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，卡特琳娜小姐，你好呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"因為《德克薩斯之死》的第二幕快要正式演出了，所以我最近打算努力一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，已經到了這個日子了嗎，我都忘了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能天使，吃披薩嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，卡特琳娜小姐既然是劇本作者，到時候一定會來看吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我其實就是想來告訴你，我會暫時離開一段時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"你要離開很久嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......如果順利的話，應該不會很久吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，不是什麼大事，家裡出了點狀況，我這個做大姐的，要回去主持一下大局而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當姐姐的還真是辛苦欸......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，還好啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只可惜，第三幕的高潮我還是沒有想好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，但願這次回老家能找到一些靈感吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，別露出這副表情嘛，只是平時見不到了而已，第二幕的上演我應該會抽空去看的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說不定到時候去後台找你玩哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟是好不容易交到的朋友，而且又是我自己寫的劇本，我也想在近距離觀賞呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，那就這麼說定了，你過來的話一定要聯絡我哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我先走了，拜拜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"拜拜~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再見~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g6_newtown_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首領，不用帶行李嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等事情處理完，我還要回這裡寫劇本呢，有什麼好帶的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩盧佐和貝洛內現在是什麼反應？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩盧佐邀請萊昂圖索少爺去赴宴，貝納爾多這頭老狼應了下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這場宴會可有意思了，現在所有人都在看著他們呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們要做些什麼反應嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瓦拉赫，幫我安排一場行程。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要去看《德克薩斯之死》第二幕的上演。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就這麼關心自己寫的劇本嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，這可是我的心血之作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，你不是問我們要做什麼反應嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是我的反應，既然貝納爾多·貝洛內都從他的劇院裡走出來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我，喬萬娜·羅塞蒂，也該回來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_101_sora","aliases":["空"]}]}
